# {{HelperName}}

## Purpose

`{{HelperName}}` is an optional integration helper.

It connects two or more standalone root packages without making those root packages depend on each other.

## Important

This helper is not required by any root package.

Root packages must remain independently copyable and testable.

## Privacy

If this helper maps errors, networking, diagnostics, analytics, push notifications, deep links, or logs, it must sanitize sensitive data.

Forbidden by default:

```text
raw URL query/fragment;
HTTP headers;
HTTP body;
notification title/body;
tokens;
String(describing: error) for unknown errors.
```

## Usage

Add this helper package only when both integrated root packages are present in the host project.
